<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

    <PropertyGroup>
        <Title>Stride Community Toolkit - Bullet Physics</Title>
        <Description>Bullet Physics helpers for the Stride Community Toolkit, for projects on Stride's Bullet-based physics.

What's inside:
- UseBullet() on SceneSetup3D or SceneSetup2D: the scene setup with Bullet physics
- CreatePrimitive with BulletPhysicsOptions: a primitive with a matching Bullet collider, plus AddBulletPhysics and AddInfinite3DGround
- Raycasting from a camera, the mouse, an entity or a RaySegment, including penetrating casts that return every hit

Maintenance mode: kept working, not extended. New projects should use Stride.CommunityToolkit.Bepu.$(StrideVersionNote)</Description>
    </PropertyGroup>

    <Import Project="..\CommonSettings.props" />

    <ItemGroup>
        <PackageReference Include="Stride.Physics" Version="$(StrideVersion)" />
    </ItemGroup>

    <ItemGroup>
        <ProjectReference Include="..\Stride.CommunityToolkit\Stride.CommunityToolkit.csproj" />
    </ItemGroup>

</Project>